d":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in `4.4-dev4`\r\n- **Not** reproducible in `4.4-dev3`\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev4 - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Tue Oct  8 03:11:08 UTC 2024 on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Laptop GPU - AMD Ryzen 9 5900HX with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI updated to `4.4-dev4` and noticed that I have *7 orphan nodes*. I reopened the same project in `4.4-dev3` and there were no orphans there. This is the output of `print_orphan_nodes()`:\r\n```\r\n32631686465 - Stray Node:  (Type: PopupMenu)\r\n32782681410 - Stray Node: /@ScrollContainer@2/_v_scroll (Type: VScrollBar)\r\n32715572554 - Stray Node: /@ScrollContainer@2 (Type: ScrollContainer)\r\n32749126992 - Stray Node: /@ScrollContainer@2/_h_scroll (Type: HScrollBar)\r\n32816235887 - Stray Node: /@ScrollContainer@2/@Control@3 (Type: Control)\r\n32849790321 - Stray Node: /@Timer@4 (Type: Timer)\r\n32866567538 - Stray Node: /@Timer@5 (Type: Timer)\r\n```\r\nThere is nothing in my project called `PopupMenu`. :man_shrugging: \r\nBut after some trial & error, it appears that having a single `Control` node gives these new orphans.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new project, add a Control node, save, run.\r\nWhile it's running check the orphan nodes counter.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nOpen the project:\r\n[control_orphans.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17688863/control_orphans.zip)\r\nAnd when you run it, check the orphans.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98999/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98999/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}